%!PS
<< /PageSize [288 432] >> setpagedevice
4 setlinewidth 6 6 276 420 rectstroke
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 28 scalefont setfont
20 380 moveto (TOP - Helett H30C) show
/Helvetica findfont 16 scalefont setfont
20 340 moveto (Linux CUPS + TSPL driver) show
20 315 moveto (203 dpi test label) show
% fake barcode
0 1 60 { dup 4 mul 30 add 150 moveto 0 120 rlineto (x) pop dup 3 mod 0 eq {3} {1.5} ifelse setlinewidth stroke pop } for
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 22 scalefont setfont
20 40 moveto (BOTTOM) show
showpage
